<title>AUSTRALIA: Kilkenny Gold makes bid for Kalmet.</title>
<headline>Kilkenny Gold makes bid for Kalmet.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kilkenny Gold NL said on Monday it would make a conditional takeover bid for Kalmet Resources Nl.</p>
<p>Kilkenny said the offer valued Kalmet at about 29 cents a share or A$23 million.</p>
</text>
